id: pm-ea1yh2
title: "GH-1132: opt-in idempotent annotation append (ifAbsent/--if-absent) prevents retry-driven context duplication; duplicate appends remain available by default"
description: "Retried comment, note, and learning mutations could append byte-identical author/text entries repeatedly, permanently bloating append-only history and downstream context projections. Deliver one public SDK-first if-absent primitive across every annotation family, with thin CLI and MCP transports, structured changed receipts, canonical contracts/completions, token-budget ratchets, and fresh-workspace acceptance proof."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-27T23:17:20.508Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-28T09:01:41.461Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-28T09:01:40.883Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-28T09:01:40.883Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: "Public SDK options and result types expose idempotent if-absent semantics for comments, text/JSON notes, and learnings; CLI --if-absent and MCP ifAbsent share the SDK implementation; resolved author plus normalized stored text define equality; first adds report changed true and exact retries changed false without history or cache mutation; default adds still permit intentional duplicates; concurrency, help, contracts, completions, SDK surface, docs, unit/integration/MCP/manual tests, exact coverage, static quality, security, and packed-consumer gates pass."
parent: pm-yql1
risk: medium
confidence: high
severity: medium
repro_steps: "Run pm comments, pm notes, or pm learnings twice with the same add payload and author, then inspect annotation collections and history; before this fix each retry stored another identical entry and add event."
resolution: "Deliver opt-in writer-lock idempotent annotation appends across SDK, CLI, and MCP with flat and nested input parity while preserving intentional duplicate defaults."
expected_result: "Explicit ifAbsent retries add once and then return changed false across comments, notes, and learnings; default appends remain compatible and duplicable."
actual_result: "Contracts, SDK surface, 100/100/100/100 coverage, tracker-context static quality, and the 231-test SDK/CLI/MCP regression bundle passed in one fresh 4/4 linked run."
affected_version: 2026.8.27
component: SDK annotations and CLI/MCP annotation transports
